  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d01777f1-d9f1-144e-9bb0-1097708a00e2"],
 " selects its lowest-energy eigenstates after sorting."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1333970281,ExpressionUUID->"80d9c06c-003b-df4e-8915-54e8d25d2134"],

